stateDiagram-v2
direction TB
state "CONFIGURED<br/>确认配置已保存" as Configured
state "PREPARING<br/>本次取得执行占用" as Preparing
state "RUNNING<br/>准备进入BL进程调用" as Running
state "STOPPED<br/>本次操作停止" as Stopped
state "JSON_READY<br/>原JSON结构和正文检查通过" as JsonReady
[*] --> Configured : confirm成功 / 发布配置及摘要
Configured --> Preparing : transcribe明确授权、配置有效且execution不存在 / 独占创建目录
Preparing --> Running : prepare_input完成 / 内存设置RUNNING与unknown
Preparing --> Stopped : 准备失败或首次记录保存失败 / not_started
Running --> Stopped : RUNNING保存失败或BL进程启动失败 / not_started
Running --> Stopped : BL等待失败或该阶段本地异常 / unknown
Running --> JsonReady : BL结束且结果结构与正文通过检查 / result_received
JsonReady --> JsonReady : 成功记录已保存 / 附加delivery
note right of Configured
  配置文件保持CONFIGURED与execution_authorized=false
  执行授权和状态另记入execution/status.json
  授权或配置错误发生在占用之前
end note
note right of Running
  先设置RUNNING；记录保存成功后调用BL
  磁盘RUNNING是保守记录，不证明进程存活或云端受理
  unknown表示当前可证实的云端范围未知
end note
note right of Stopped
  execution目录永久保留，同job最多取得一次执行占用
  授权与配置通过后的重复调用读取既有记录
  业务异常由error.phase定位
  记录保存失败由record_error.phase说明
end note
note right of JsonReady
  当次JSON_READY回执与磁盘记录分开理解
  成功记录保存失败则提前返回，documents_ready=false
  磁盘仍可能为RUNNING，当前export因此拒绝
  成功记录已保存后才开始导出
  delivery为COMPLETE时documents_ready=true
end note
note left of Preparing
  本图建模dict中的状态字符串，代码没有State类
  delivery/status.json另记EXPORTING、COMPLETE、PARTIAL、FAILED
  读取损坏记录或导出中断可合成OUTCOME_UNKNOWN
  源码：scripts/asr_transcription/application/transcription.py、delivery.py
  文件协议：scripts/asr_transcription/utils/job_files.py
end note
